ket.", "CRM & Tracking", "https://hyros.com"], ["Loom", "Record quick video walkthroughs for clients and prospects.", "CRM & Tracking", "https://www.loom.com"], ["Canva", "Fast creative and graphic design. Proposals, ads and mockups.", "Creative", "https://www.canva.com"], ["Stripe", "Payment processing for client invoicing. The default for most offers.", "Payments", "https://stripe.com"], ["Wise", "International payments with low fees. Useful for foreign clients.", "Payments", "https://wise.com"], ["Square", "Payments, invoices and POS. For B2B invoice flows and non-Stripe clients.", "Payments", "https://squareup.com"], ["Discord", "The community. Calls, wins and questions.", "Community", "https://discord.com"]]'::jsonb where key = 'resources';
